=== Pool/Handle Pattern ===

Creating linked list with handles:
List values: 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> end

Creating game entities:

Entity relationships:
Player (HP: 100) -> targets Goblin
Goblin (HP: 50) -> targets Player
Orc (HP: 80) -> targets Player

Applying damage:
Goblin health: 30
Player health: 90

Removing defeated enemy:
Enemy1 removed from pool

=== Key Benefits ===
- No lifetime parameters
- Handles never dangle (invalidation explicit)
- Perfect for graphs, entity systems, UI trees
- Pool owns memory, handles are lightweight IDs
